            "text": "theorem norm_Gr_le (s : ℂ) (δ : ℝ) {θ : ℝ} (hθ : |θ| < π / 4) (hs : -2 < s.re)\n    (hsg : 0 ≤ θ * s.im) :\n    ‖Gr s δ 0‖ ≤ Real.exp (-(|θ| * |s.im|)) * ∫ r in Ioi (0:ℝ),\n      r ^ (s.re + 1) * Real.exp (-(Real.cos (2 * θ) / 2) * r ^ 2 + (2 * π * |δ| * |Real.sin θ|) * r) :=",
